      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "- Added the ability for desktop users to rotate objects while holding them! While in Desktop mode, pick up an object, and:\n  - Press I / K to adjust pitch of the held object (rotate along X axis)\n  - Press J / L to adjust yaw of the held object (rotate along Y axis)\n  - Press U / O to adjust roll of the held object (rotate along Z axis)\n  - Roll the mouse wheel to move the object forward/back (translate along Z axis)\nIn newest open beta VRChat 2020.3.3, build 992.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
